1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,692
Now squeeze the slit.

2
00:00:01,692 --> 00:00:05,520
Halve its width, and the central maximum doubles in width.

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,877
That is the puzzle from the start, explained.

4
00:00:07,877 --> 00:00:17,669
Only when the slit is very wide compared with lambda does the patch shrink to a sharp shadow of the slit, which is why ray optics works for ordinary openings.

